#: {{ux|is|Ég er mjög '''svangur'''.|I'm really '''hungry'''.}}
# {{lb|is|obsolete}} [[thin]], [[slender]], [[slim]]
#: {{syn|is|mjór|grannur|[[magur]]|[[mjósleginn]]}}

